arbeitnow:fullstack-engineer-consumer-or:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're building the definitive online food company, transforming the way the world eats by making hyper-local food more convenient and accessible. We're at the forefront of an industry, powered by our market-leading technology and unrivalled network to bring incredible convenience and selection to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Deliveroo is the perfect environment to build a definitive career, motivated by impact on your own development, on Deliveroo as we scale, and on the marketplace and communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Ordering Experience&lt;/strong&gt; owns the core purchase journey: the store page, item page, basket, and checkout flow, across both app and web. It's a global team — the surfaces we build support all of our brands: Deliveroo, Wolt, and Doordash. You'd be the team's first dedicated web/full-stack engineer, helping us build out our web experience from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the store, item, basket, and checkout experiences on web, working primarily in React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to backend services written in Golang — deep Go experience isn't a hard requirement, but you should be comfortable picking up a new statically typed backend language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve code structure, shape architecture, and review code across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with your Product Manager and fellow engineers to scope and ship changes to the ordering funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the hiring process and support the growth of your teammates as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We're Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack experience — comfortable working across web frontend (React/TypeScript) and backend (Go, or similar) to unblock delivery end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, implementing and rolling out A/B experiments (or strong aptitude to quickly learn our experimentation platform) — including guardrail metrics, staged rollouts and reading results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving, ambiguous environment with shifting priorities and short XP cycles (weeks, not quarters)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset — able to take a brief PRD through design, implementation, rollout and production monitoring with minimal hand-holding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping incrementally and iterating on data rather than big-bang launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to participate in an on-call rotation and respond to incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating engineers across multiple platforms (iOS/Android/Web/BE) on a single initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active use of AI-assisted coding workflows, and interest in building reusable tooling/skills for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're looking for someone &lt;strong&gt;London-based&lt;/strong&gt; who can work &lt;strong&gt;from our office 2–3 days a week&lt;/strong&gt; alongside the rest of the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community organisers, proud parents, and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our&lt;a href="https://deliveroo.engineering"&gt; Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our&lt;a href="https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/"&gt; Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:staff-software-engineer-dev-en:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Dev Environments team sits within DoorDash's Foundations group (Platform Engineering). We own the local and remote developer experience across the DoorDash group of companies supporting over 5000 engineers. Our mission is to enable engineering velocity, quality, and efficiency at significant scale by removing friction from the day-to-day developer loop: spinning up a working environment, getting code building, and getting feedback fast, whether the "developer" is a human or an AI agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on Dev Environments, you'll be recognised as an expert across the dev environments space, covering both local and remote dev flows, devcontainers, IDE/remote backends, and how they all fit together, including owning accountability for outcomes that span multiple teams. You'll set technical direction for the team's roadmap, unblock deep cross-cutting technical problems other engineers can't resolve alone, and mentor senior and mid-level engineers. You'll partner closely with engineering leadership across the group to translate ambiguous, company-wide developer-experience problems into a concrete, sequenced technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Technical direction&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define the architecture for how thousands of engineers across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo actually develop and ship code: local and remote dev containers, remote IDE/VM lifecycle, and the full local-to-remote loop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build monorepo dev tooling at scale. It's part of consolidating all the companies under DoorDash’s umbrella onto one global backend - you're setting the standard, not patching one org's tooling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Provision production-shaped environments in seconds, keep state in sync over the network, and make a remote machine feel local, reliably and cheaply, at thousands-of-concurrent-engineers scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Expect to invent as much as you adopt: much of this is genuinely unsolved elsewhere in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Design for AI agents as first-class consumers of the environment, not an afterthought: sandboxes that spin up on demand, run in parallel, and are safe to hand a real repo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support agents launched from an IDE, a CLI, or a Slack message - with no laptop required to review and ship what the agent did.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; leadership&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Align teams that don't naturally sit adjacent to each other (e.g. Security, Infrastructure, Product Engineering) around unstructured, ambiguous problems where there's no existing playbook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentor engineers at all levels: run design reviews; raise the engineering bar through code review, pairing, and architectural guidance when appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Help set the hiring bar: lead interview loops, help calibrate, and support onboarding of senior hires.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Essential:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A track record of shipping production systems and leading cross-team initiatives with group level impact - comfortable owning delivery end to end, from design through to production and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hands on fluency with the languages and tooling used to build developer tooling (e.g. Go, Python, TypeScript) and infrastructure-as-code (Terraform).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience managing compute via Kubernetes (multi-tenant workload isolation, autoscaling ephemeral workloads, cost management), or lightweight VM/sandbox technology (e.g. Firecracker).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of cloud networking, including securely and cost-effectively routing traffic across network boundaries (VPNs, service meshes, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating LLM/AI tooling into developer workflows - e.g. Claude Code - both locally, and remotely.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication; able to influence senior stakeholders and align multiple non-adjacent teams without formal authority over them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience building close working relationships with the engineering teams who consume your platform, not just the platform team itself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in developer platforms or adjacent infrastructure: devcontainers, remote development, remote IDE backends, or developer workstation tooling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Practical experience with JetBrains remote-backend flows, Codespaces/Codeserver-style products, or equivalent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with remote build/execution systems (e.g. BuildBuddy), or large-scale build caching.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a target="_blank" class="ng-star-inserted" href="https://deliveroo.engineering"&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. &lt;a target="_blank" class="ng-star-inserted" href="https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/"&gt;Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:paid-search-manager-89677:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position sits in our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; service. We combine data, technology, creative content, and paid media to crack brands’ business problems &amp;amp; drive revenue through a variety of digital marketing solutions like ad campaigns, augmented reality, and chatbots. Our clients include ASOS, Just Eat Takeaway, Twitch, TikTok, and The White Company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at DEPT®, we are proud of the award winning, creative campaigns and content that we produce for a range of exciting and well known brands, and we believe that our Media Team is pivotal in the success of those campaigns. Our Media Team is made up of both paid and organic media specialists and we are looking for a new SEA Specialist to join the team to service an exciting new client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a critical thinker and analytical problem solver, equally curious and creative. You have a strong command of paid search platforms, such as Google Ads and Bing Ads, and can effectively communicate complex ideas to clients and internal stakeholders. You have a track record of driving results and optimizing campaigns to meet client objectives. As a key member of the team, you will contribute to the growth and success of our clients' digital campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU'LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multi-market paid search and shopping campaigns for clients;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct keyword research and analysis to identify relevant search terms and opportunities for campaign optimisation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean into automation and use of data within campaigns, including utilising AI to improve performance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and optimize paid search campaigns across various platforms, such as Google Ads and Bing Ads;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor campaign performance, analyse data, and provide regular reports to clients, highlighting key metrics and recommendations for improvement;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices in paid search advertising;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless execution of campaigns and alignment with client goals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about changes in search engine algorithms and adjust strategies accordingly;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out technical analysis, content &amp;amp; authority analysis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up implementation plans and workflows;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to client (internal and external) briefs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on activity on weekly, monthly and quarterly basis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a direct client communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing and optimising paid search &amp;amp; shopping campaigns, preferably within a digital agency or similar environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of paid search platforms, such as Google Ads and Bing Ads;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with client communication;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills and ability to interpret data to drive campaign optimisation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate or higher proficiency in the use of Excel/Sheets and familiarity with Word/Docs and PowerPoint/Slides;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and organisational skills with a high attention to detail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to react quickly within a fast-paced environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly available to start working from either our Manchester or London office;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full working proficiency in the English language;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office, depending on location);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refreshments are provided in the office all week, as well as drinks at 4 pm on a Thursday;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href="https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/"&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with big names and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
